{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_slice_3b", "label": "Slice 3b \u2014 3MF Ingest", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Split out of slice 3 because two formats with opposite risk profiles under one heading is what makes a slice overrun: an OBJ bug produces a wrong mesh, a 3MF bug is a denial of service. They deserve separate reviews."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "label": "parse_3mf", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_caps", "label": "Caps \u2014 Decompressed Size, Entries, Ratio, Triangles", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Compiled in and not configurable: a security control with an environment override is one an operator can switch off by accident. Injectable in tests so the hostile fixture is a few hundred bytes rather than a multi-gigabyte file. Breach is checked as bytes arrive through Read::take \u2014 inflating an entry and then measuring it is the bomb working as designed."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_unit_conversion", "label": "3MF Unit Conversion to Millimetres", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The first ingest path where the source states a unit. An absent unit defaults to millimetre per the 3MF core spec; an unrecognised one is refused rather than defaulted, because guessing millimetres for a file that said inch scales the part by 25.4 and produces measurements that are wrong, plausible and silent."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_components_depth_cap", "label": "Component Recursion Depth Cap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "An object may reference other objects in a cycle, which is an infinite loop on input we do not control. A depth cap ends it and costs one counter."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_rels_start_part", "label": "The Model Part Is Found Through the Relationships", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Reading 3D/3dmodel.model directly would work for almost every file. Following _rels/.rels costs one small XML parse and lets a legal 3MF whose model lives elsewhere ingest, leaving only a genuinely malformed package as the failure."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_compression_policy", "label": "Compression::{Zstd, AsIs} Source Policy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "3MF is already a deflate ZIP, so re-compressing it with zstd spends CPU on every ingest to make the file very slightly larger. The table lives in one place with its reasoning beside it, rather than as a boolean at a call site where the next reader cannot tell what true meant."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_refused", "label": "CadError::ArchiveRefused", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "A bomb may be perfectly well-formed, so 'Re-export it' is wrong advice for a file refused on size; an operator needs to know a limit fired rather than a parser failed."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_zip_quickxml_deps", "label": "zip + quick-xml Dependency Review", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The hand-rolled parsers in this crate are geometry parsers, where a bug is a wrong mesh; a hand-rolled archive reader's bugs are vulnerabilities. Both crates are pure Rust so no C toolchain enters the worker image and cargo vendor still builds offline. quick-xml is pinned at 0.41 as a security floor: 0.37 carries RUSTSEC-2026-0194 and -0195, exactly the threats the caps exist to stop."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_rar_licence_dead_end", "label": "RAR Is a Licence Dead End", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The corpus is distributed as .rar and the only complete decoder is the unrar C library, whose licence is not OSI-approved and collides with AGPL-3.0-only, cargo-deny's allow-list and cargo vendor. The archive slice must decide explicitly rather than discovering it."}, {"id": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_geometry_amplification", "label": "Post-Decompression Geometry Amplification", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "contributor": null, "author": null, "rationale": "The three archive caps bound what comes out of the ZIP and say nothing about what the model then generates: components branching gives geometry as branching^depth, and a 604-byte package emitted 16.7M triangles at ~10^6x amplification. Caps::max_triangles closes it, checked as triangles accumulate rather than after."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_slice_3b", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3_lod_design_slice_3", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3_lod_design_extension_dispatch", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_caps", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_unit_conversion", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_components_depth_cap", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_rels_start_part", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_parse_3mf", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_refused", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_caps", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_geometry_amplification", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_caps", "target": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_refused", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3b_3mf_design_archive_refused", "target": "specs_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_design_handler_error", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-04-phase-1-slice-3b-3mf-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_09_04_phase_1_slice_3